<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  plMail's "pl" mark, transcribed from the server's own macro
  (templates/_partials/_logo_mark.html.twig) so the phone and the web wear the
  same logo. Seven strokes in a fixed draw order — p-stem, p-top-curve,
  p-right-stem, p-bowl-bottom, l-upper, l-lower, l-tail — copied verbatim
  rather than redrawn, because a hand-traced logo drifts from the original the
  first time either side changes. It had already drifted: the geometry here was
  a superseded version of the letters.

  One colour, because this is the themed-icon layer: the platform paints the
  silhouette in whatever the user's wallpaper produced, so any colour written
  here is thrown away. Black is the convention for "the shape, no paint".

  Geometry, scale and translate are identical to ic_launcher_foreground and
  must stay that way — a themed icon that traced slightly different letters
  from the coloured one is the same logo drawn twice, which is how the two
  drift apart.

  ## The arithmetic, for whoever rescales this

  An adaptive-icon foreground is a 108dp canvas whose outer ring is cropped by
  whatever mask the launcher applies; only a circle of radius 33 about the
  centre is guaranteed to survive. The source is a 48-unit square whose inner
  group translates by (-4.5, -0.5) — that is the macro's own transform, kept so
  the paths below are diffable against the twig character for character.

  After that translate the ink spans x 5.75..42.25 and y 3.75..44.25, centred
  exactly on (24, 24). Half-extents are 18.25 and 20.25, so at scale 1.2 the
  furthest corner of the ink's bounding box sits sqrt(21.9² + 24.3²) ≈ 32.7
  from the centre — inside the safe circle, with little to spare. The outer
  group's translate is 54 - 24 × 1.2 = 25.2 on both axes, which is what puts
  the drawing's centre on the canvas's.

  Rescaling means redoing that arithmetic, not nudging the numbers until it
  looks right.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <group
        android:scaleX="1.2"
        android:scaleY="1.2"
        android:translateX="25.2"
        android:translateY="25.2">

        <group
            android:translateX="-4.5"
            android:translateY="-0.5">

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M13,11 L13,42"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M13,11 Q13,7 17,7 L23,7 Q29,7 29,13"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M29,13 L29,22"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M29,22 Q29,26 23,26 L17,26 Q13,26 13,22"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M37,7 L37,26"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M37,26 L37,37"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

            <path
                android:fillColor="#00000000"
                android:pathData="M37,37 Q37,42 42,42 L44,42"
                android:strokeColor="#000000"
                android:strokeWidth="5.5"
                android:strokeLineCap="round"
                android:strokeLineJoin="round" />

        </group>
    </group>
</vector>
